    setup: '<p>A founder owns 100% of a profitable, family-built specialty chemicals business in Germany generating €30m EBITDA. He has been approached unsolicited by a US strategic acquirer offering 8x EBITDA. His investment banker recommends running a competitive auction instead, projecting that 2&ndash;3 strategic and 4&ndash;5 PE bidders could be brought to the table.</p>',
